|ษออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออ Help ออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออป|
|บ    Logging in                                                                บ|
|บ                                                                              บ|
|บ    Type your user name and press Enter, then your password and Enter.        บ|
|บ    The password is not shown while you type it.  User names are upper        บ|
|บ    case; the password is checked exactly as typed.                           บ|
|บ                                                                              บ|
|บ    After three failed attempts the session ends and the program stops.       บ|
|บ    An account that must change its password goes to the password screen      บ|
|บ    first.                                                                    บ|
|บ                                                                              บ|
|บ    The first time: the sample data has the users ADMIN, OPER and READER;     บ|
|บ    a new, empty data directory has the one user ADMIN.  The first            บ|
|บ    password is the user name in lower case (admin, oper, reader); a new      บ|
|บ    one is asked for at the first login.                                      บ|
|บ                                                                              บ|
|บ    Esc or F3 leaves the program.                                             บ|
|บ                                                                              บ|
