|ษออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออ Help ออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออป|
|บ    The home screen                                                           บ|
|บ                                                                              บ|
|บ    It shows who is logged in, the access level, today's date, and how        บ|
|บ    many items, locations and categories the inventory holds.  A date         บ|
|บ    before 1990 means the PC's clock was never set: set it with the DOS       บ|
|บ    command DATE, as loans, reservations and service records take today's     บ|
|บ    date.  With no items yet, Items > New item adds the first; Locations >    บ|
|บ    New location adds the rooms, shelves and boxes to keep them in.           บ|
|บ                                                                              บ|
|บ      F10          open the menu bar                                          บ|
|บ      Alt-letter   open the menu of that letter                               บ|
|บ      Ctrl-F       search the items                                           บ|
|บ      F3           quit (asks first)                                          บ|
|บ      F9           the keys every screen has                                  บ|
|บ                                                                              บ|
