|บ    The menu bar                                                              บ|
|บ                                                                              บ|
|บ      Left, Right  the previous or next menu                                  บ|
|บ      Up, Down     move between the entries                                   บ|
|บ      Enter        choose the selected entry                                  บ|
|บ      letter       choose the entry of that letter                            บ|
|บ      Esc, F10     close the menu                                             บ|
|บ                                                                              บ|
|บ    Entries drawn dimmed need a higher access level than yours; choosing      บ|
|บ    one says so.  A click on a title opens that menu, on an entry chooses     บ|
|บ    it; a click elsewhere closes the menu.  The last menu, Record, holds      บ|
|บ    what the screen shown can do with its records, each entry naming its      บ|
|บ    key when it has one.                                                      บ|
